    "detailed_description": "<strong>Too late to fixed</strong><br>The world is finally in an unreturnable condition. war, chemicals, nuclear, global warming, and widespread plastic pollution causing problems that are too late to fix, and now all humanity pays the price for it. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/02e50bd7222d857999f65d59f43be543.poster.avif?t=1717742690\" width=640 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/02e50bd7222d857999f65d59f43be543.webm?t=1717742690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/02e50bd7222d857999f65d59f43be543.mp4?t=1717742690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>Third-Person-Shooter</strong><br>fighting against military bandits and other survivors around the map. keep yourself safe and survive the raid to get all the resources or lose it all with just one bullet from the enemy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/2765ae71270d5ba5ffe7ba38d2894021.poster.avif?t=1717742690\" width=640 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/2765ae71270d5ba5ffe7ba38d2894021.webm?t=1717742690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/2765ae71270d5ba5ffe7ba38d2894021.mp4?t=1717742690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>Looting to upgrade </strong><br>upgrade all the equipment, hideout, and gear to prepare yourself before every match. take out the best of your build and fight every enemy in front of you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/2ece182f968aae466c00951095209c54.poster.avif?t=1717742690\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/2ece182f968aae466c00951095209c54.webm?t=1717742690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/2ece182f968aae466c00951095209c54.mp4?t=1717742690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>Survive with friend</strong><br>Host or join a session to play and survive with your friend or maybe\u2026 fight with them instead!. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/db5f34fa5ee02ab8fd4abbe6d20f6a69.poster.avif?t=1717742690\" width=640 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/db5f34fa5ee02ab8fd4abbe6d20f6a69.webm?t=1717742690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/db5f34fa5ee02ab8fd4abbe6d20f6a69.mp4?t=1717742690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>Rare gun from the boss</strong><br>Get an SVN sniper rifle-type gun that can only drop from \u2018Garry\u2019, the big boss in Sarasin area.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/16160bac35d9e95849c3890df8662f9f.poster.avif?t=1717742690\" width=640 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/16160bac35d9e95849c3890df8662f9f.webm?t=1717742690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/16160bac35d9e95849c3890df8662f9f.mp4?t=1717742690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>Phuket in post-apocalyptic theme</strong><br>Play in one of the most famous cities in Thailand \u2018Phuket\u2019. With an outstanding landmark that can only be seen in Phuket!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/160ba07e6d24a7759997de4dd7a3e4cf.poster.avif?t=1717742690\" width=640 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/160ba07e6d24a7759997de4dd7a3e4cf.webm?t=1717742690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/160ba07e6d24a7759997de4dd7a3e4cf.mp4?t=1717742690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
