=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/2ece182f968aae466c00951095209c54.poster.avif?t=1717742690\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/2ece182f968aae466c00951095209c54.webm?t=1717742690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/2ece182f968aae466c00951095209c54.mp4?t=1717742690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>Survive with friend</strong><br>Host or join a session to play and survive with your friend or maybe\u2026 fight with them instead!. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/db5f34fa5ee02ab8fd4abbe6d20f6a69.poster.avif?t=1717742690\" width=640 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/db5f34fa5ee02ab8fd4abbe6d20f6a69.webm?t=1717742690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/db5f34fa5ee02ab8fd4abbe6d20f6a69.mp4?t=1717742690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>Rare gun from the boss</strong><br>Get an SVN sniper rifle-type gun that can only drop from \u2018Garry\u2019, the big boss in Sarasin area.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/16160bac35d9e95849c3890df8662f9f.poster.avif?t=1717742690\" width=640 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985370/extras/16160bac35d9e95849c3890df8662f9f.webm?t=1717742690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"